        "text": "HasDerivAt (fun t => t ^ e * physicalSigma P e q F (t, p)) (-r ^ e * physicalAdjusted P e q F (r, p)) r, for every e : ℕ; dividing by r^e gives (D_r + e/R)(physicalSigma) = -(F - bump), the e-general identity with a zero cutoff remainder"
